{"id": "De9lGqHyPud", "title": "Video by devanshu.motion", "description": "\"Le lo moti Raja!\" A Brahmin screamed this while burning alive with his whole family. And from that fire began the Dussehra of Kullu. 🔥\n\nKullu, 17th century. Raja Jagat Singh heard that a poor Brahmin of Tipri village, Durga Dutt, had a bowl full of pearls. The king's men came to his door again and again. He promised to give them when the Raja returned from Manikaran. The Raja returned. The door was locked from inside.\n\nFrom that day the rice on the Raja's plate turned into worms, and the water in his lota turned into blood.\n\nOnly Shri Ram could save him. But Ram's murti was in Ayodhya. Part 2 👀\n\nPart 1 of 2. Shadow puppet animation.\n\nHave you ever seen Kullu Dussehra? 👇\n\n#kulludussehra #dussehra #raghunathji #himachalpradesh❤️ #jaishreeram🚩", "channel": "devanshu.motion", "uploader_id": "25176808901", "uploader": "Devanshu Singhai", "timestamp": 1793027890, "like_count": 3822, "comment_count": 40, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1731325267961145a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 70.293, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPxVUJ5WuEaqN9U5D_fSqaXTUqPPjsgjbEKoauSvWvmPZ0Zq6-jFNzDygsk7nO_pWhThf5R4ZPsKnpRAFiqNXmpL02PicygHFwX728.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=Ado0Dt4gcBhPkhd19NH2z9UWQXBvXq7teHBDXnjFHyAt_mypcTesgM7nNsfNCjke3fwzvtj2xP2x_Qe-2jFuqZae&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=gE8LzJAaa6wQ7kNvwGzWqyG&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=QWmrLOB_sP1u9fs2qQZ4DQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQJycX2wMOHouNANieKQpSVbWGzRw-tvNERO9mBKAWfkw&oe=6AF40C30", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 70.293, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows N